'''Torch''' is a utility [[Clubs|club]] which can be equipped in both main and off-hand.

* Its primary attack is a 3-hit combo with double damage on the last hit.
* It does not have a secondary attack.

It provides light. When equipped, it has the same effect as a fire, scaring off [[Neck]]s, untamed [[Boar]]s, [[Greyling]]s and [[Greydwarf]]s.

