== Notes ==
* The player starts the game with a torch. 
* The torch passively loses durability when equipped and will stay lit for a maximum of 10 minutes ([[Day_and_Night_Cycle|night]] lasts for nine minutes). 
* Torches cannot be repaired and will simply disappear when their durability reaches 0%. 
* Cannot be placed on an [[Item Stand]]. 
* Despite its description, the torch does not provide the player with [[Fire Effect|warmth]].   

